--- !u!114 &1154401991
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1154401989}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7b9f966cbd6145439b4e401d06d75d46, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogLines:
  - lines:
    - supersoldier gas test 13D21
    - test subjects are lab rat and first human being
    - initializing in 3... 2... 1...
  - lines:
    - Test subject rat shows muscle grouth and agression
    - test subject human is dead
    - should continue testing on animals to achive stable formula
  - lines:
    - Hi there! Hope I didn't scare ya!
    - 'We''ve heard of your exploits. The way you handled the drone factory was incredibly
      cool! '
    - But unfortunately, they have a couple more drone manufacturing facilities that
      you'll encounter on your way.
    - These people are developing some kind of drug that will be capable of turning
      animals and people into weapons of war.
    - "Currently, they are testing this drug on us\u2014the rats. Sometimes, some
      of us manage to escape during a poorly conducted experiment."
    - But we are running out of time now, go to the lab and save more animals! We
      will talk later...
  - lines:
    - By the way, I'm the first rat to escape. I was a special experiment.
    - ' As you can see, I''m bigger than the others and I have a weapon. It played
      into my hands. '
    - After me, they changed their security measures and don't make such powerful
      rats.
    - I'll open another door for you, be careful there!
  - lines:
    - We will get the information very quickly. So when we find out something important,
      I will either send a messenger to you, or I will inform you personally in the
      sewers.
    - Before you go further come and chekout our hide out!
    - Oh, and visit out sientist! he has a gift for you
    - See you there!
  - lines:
    - Do you like our home?
    - it would be even more pleasant to be here if it weren't for what's going on
      upstairs.
    - But we are grateful for what we have.
    - Here is the key to the last room, we found out that a particularly massive
      experiment will be conducted there.
    - We'll come for backup as soon as we can.
  - lines:
    - Hello friend!
    - Here take this, it will give you some defence against their weapons
    - We stole it from those scientists, let's turn it against them now!
  - lines:
    - Thanks for saving me!
  - lines:
    - This body isn't that bad
    - except i can't scratch my back now...
